  "model": "f(n,s)=n*(f1+Δf1)*2^((cents_s+Δcents)/1200)*sqrt((1+b*n*n)/(1+b)) + hz_s+Δhz；a(n,s)=(0.05/n**0.8)*10^(amp_db/20)；φ(n,s)=phase0+0.41n+0.63s（indexed）或 phase0+0.41n（shared）+phase_deg；附加模态 φ=phase0+0.41n+1.1+0.37i；包络 none|exp(-t/τ)（n>=from_partial）|w*exp(-t/τf)+(1-w)*exp(-t/τs)；调制 am: 幅度×(1+depth*cos(2πf_m t))；drift_linear: f(t)=fc+span/T*(t-T/2)；fm_sinusoidal: f(t)=fc+depth*sin(2πf_m t)（漂移/调频的相位按解析积分）；噪声：default_rng(seed) 每声道独立高斯（先左后右）",
  "pcm": "round-to-nearest sample*8388608；24-bit signed 双声道；无归一化；非有限或峰值>=0.95 即用例失败",
